  establishes why, replacing the slice-3 prose claim ('BLOCKED on Joe naming
  the policy family') with numbers. Every count below is produced by
  holes/labs/wm-contract/f1_policy_family_census.bb over data/wm-trace, which
  is read-only, takes no run lock and prints identically on an unchanged
  corpus. Nothing here is a ruling: no entry was written to
